<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-20T21:23:34.269Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:23:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Russia launched massive missile strikes on Kyiv, killing one person and damaging Dutch and Austrian embassies, while also hitting Poland with missiles as European drills continued nearby. Ukraine responded by striking the key bridge to Crimea for the third time this week, increasing pressure on the occupied peninsula. In Shenzhen, Trump, Xi and Putin met and pledged to increase oil supply, and Putin invited European leaders to Moscow for talks on ending the war. Macron urged Ukraine's allies to reopen the NATO membership question and Kushner said Russia is comfortable with NATO-like security guarantees for Ukraine. Battle-related deaths totaled 75,767 in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261120-russia-pummels-ukraine-with-massive-strikes-missile-hits-poland&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/19/watch-trump-putin-and-xi-sit-down-for-historic-three-way-talks&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ft.com/content/6c1b8a64-35f9-4aba-8605-45a4abdce6b8?syn-25a6b1a6=1&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/access-asia/20261120-shenzhen-trilateral-xi-jinping-s-masterclass-in-diplomatic-theatre&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckzd9nln5e6go?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/putin-proposes-second-humanitarian-ceasefire-is-it-a-trap/a-79996772?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168828&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168807&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.co